And escrow explains suspense

Escrow gives:

Outcome\ known\ conditionally
but
Outcome\ not\ yet\ released

That is almost the structure of suspense.

result = determined_or_constrained()
while not reveal_condition:
    withhold(result)
    increase_information_pressure()

So:

Suspense = informational escrow.

That one deserves to survive.

⸻

And covenant explains character

This may be the largest one.

Character can be modeled as:

Character =
policy\ that\ preserves\ invariants
across\ changing\ states

You don’t learn who someone is when nothing changes.

You perturb the environment and observe:

I(S_1), I(S_2), ..., I(S_n)

What persists?

That’s character.

So character arc becomes:

I_{old}
\rightarrow perturbations
\rightarrow contradiction
\rightarrow reconstruction
\rightarrow I_{new}

The Narrative Gym and Deal Gym have basically collided into an identity-learning system there.

